---
flowchart LR

  subgraph SUP["Solid · the argument moves forward"]
    S1["<b>supports</b><br/>A gives reason to accept B"]
    S2["<b>licenses</b><br/>Without A, the step to B is invalid"]
    S3["<b>bounds</b> · <b>compared against</b><br/>A constrains how B is measured"]
    S4["<b>motivates</b><br/>A is the reason B is proposed"]
    S5["<b>reconstructs</b><br/>A replaces a quantity shown to be wrong"]
  end

  subgraph PUSH["Dashed · the argument pushes back"]
    D1["<b>revises</b><br/>A is a prior the author now rejects"]
    D2["<b>rebuts</b><br/>A argues directly against B"]
    D3["<b>qualified by</b><br/>B limits where A holds"]
    D4["<b>undercut by</b><br/>B weakens A without refuting it"]
    D5["<b>defers</b><br/>A sets B aside explicitly"]
  end

  subgraph RULE["The rule"]
    R["An article may use <b>only</b> these ten.<br/><br/>If a relation fits none of them,<br/>the slot assignment is probably wrong.<br/><br/>Direction matters: evidence points <i>to</i><br/>what it supports. A figure measuring the<br/><i>result</i> of a mechanism is not evidence<br/>for that mechanism."]
  end

  SUP ~~~ PUSH
  PUSH ~~~ RULE

  classDef solid fill:#1F3A32,stroke:#5DCAA5,color:#E1F5EE
  classDef dash fill:#3A3A38,stroke:#B4B2A9,color:#F1EFE8,stroke-dasharray:5 4
  classDef rule fill:#2C2C2A,stroke:#F1EFE8,color:#F1EFE8,stroke-width:2px
  class S1,S2,S3,S4,S5 solid
  class D1,D2,D3,D4,D5 dash
  class R rule
